<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χραίνω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Th.</u>
			61
		</span></i>, etc., fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρᾰνῶ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					366
				</span></i>
			: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχρᾱνα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); subj.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χράνῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					327
				</span></i>
			; inf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρᾶναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					7.129
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Chr.</u>
				49
			</span></i>:—<i>touch slightly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλιγάκις ἄστυ κἀγορᾶς χραίνων
			κύκλον,</span> i.e. keeping aloof from it, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				919
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. οὐραίοισιν εὐδίαν
			ἁλός,</span> of fishes, <i><span class="en">
				Achae.
				27.3
			</span></i>: hence, <i>smear, paint,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ἢ ἀποχραίνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					769a
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				40.2
			</span></i>: <i>besmear, anoint,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				246
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χραινομένην μέλιτι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					7.622
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stain,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βωμὸν αἵματι μήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					10.111
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεδία δ᾽ ἀργηστὴς ἀφρὸς χραίνει
					σταλαγμοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					61
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				327
			</span></i>; <i>defile,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μιάσματι μυχὸν ἔχρανας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					170
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); esp. of moral pollution, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέχη δὲ τοῦ θανόντος ἐν χεροῖν ἐμαῖν
					χραίνω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					822
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1266
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hec.</u>
				366
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄμμα χ. θανασίμοισιν ἐκπνοαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					1438
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε φόνῳ τοὺς τῶν θεῶν βωμοὺς
					χραίνειν δεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					2.28
				</span></i>
			; of words, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῶν ὀνόματα μὴ χ.
				ῥᾳδίως</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				917b
			</span></i>:—
				Med.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρα χραίνεσθαι φόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Aj.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμάτων μιάσμασι χρανθεῖσα γαῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					266
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπνῷ χραίνεται πόλισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Th.</u>
					342
				</span></i>
			(lyr.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				368
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὄμματα μὴ κεχράνθαι τοῖς
					ἀσεβήμασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					7.205a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψιν τε καὶ ἀκοὴν ἐχράνθημεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					10.9
				</span></i>
			.</div>
